description: Pagekit Project Standards - Coding standard: Apply PSR-2 for PHP-CS-Fixer until Step 2.1. Step 2.1 (Static Analysis & Code Quality, ROADMAP) migrates to PSR-12/Symfony – when doing Step 2.1, migrate project-wide; thereafter PSR-12/Symfony applies. Always use explicit nullable parameters: ?Type $param = null instead of Type $param = null; Define properties explicitly instead of dynamic creation; Use Symfony ErrorHandler instead of deprecated App::exception() API; Check null parameters for string functions: strpos, strstr, ltrim, substr_count; Replace ReflectionParameter::getClass() with getType(); Always run pnpm build after JavaScript changes; Only edit source files (.js/.vue), never compiled .bundle.js files; Test all modules after changes (Frontend, Backend, API); Keep debug logs visible for context and error diagnosis; Document all fixes in CHANGELOG-NEW.md; Use conventional commit messages with detailed changelog descriptions
alwaysApply: true
